{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は短いですが！\n告知だけ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月17日  放送     オトナヘノベル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に、主演として再現ドラマに出させてもらいます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと前に撮影だったんだけど\n初めてのことだらけで緊張した！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しすぎてるところと\n親友として出るみり愛との\nいつも通りな雰囲気なところと\n見たらすぐばれちゃうかも！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、たのしい撮影で\n演技って楽しいなって思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、みてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！このオトナヘノベルの前の時間に\nRの法則が放送されるんですが\nなんと、乃木坂スペシャルです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、Rの法則をみてから\nそのままチャンネルを変えずに\nオトナヘノベルもみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/11/5488073/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/11/5488073/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレー部！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/11/5488073/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"brea